{"seq":1,"slug":"dg-emergency-response-drill","title":"泄漏与火灾应急预案及演练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-emergency-waste/dg-emergency-response-drill","wordCount":3064,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"泄漏与火灾应急预案及演练\">泄漏与火灾应急预案及演练</h1><p>凌晨两点，三号库区一托盘 UN 1263 油漆桶被叉车货叉戳穿，约 80 升易燃液体流向相邻的氧化剂货位。值班人员到做出第一个处置动作只有几分钟，他要回答的不是「油漆是什么」，而是三个可执行问题：<strong>该不该冲上去封堵</strong>、<strong>拉哪一级警报</strong>、<strong>哪些库位必须在 3 分钟内清空</strong>。答案不在预案封面上，而在预案的三层结构、货物对应的应急调度号、以及事发前演练过多少次里。本文把「预案怎么写」和「演练怎么跑」当作同一件事的两面：预案是演练的脚本，演练是预案的验证。</p>\n<p>危险货物的分类结果和库区的隔离约束是本文两个上游输入——泄漏时哪些货不能在同一个围堰里处理、火灾时哪些相邻库位会连锁反应，都由此推导，见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../dg-classification-storable/dg-un-number-class-division\">UN 编号、危险货物类别与包装等级</a> 与 <a href=\"../dg-warehouse-license-layout/dg-zone-segregation-isolation\">库区隔离与分库存储</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三层预案体系与它回答的问题\">核心概念：三层预案体系与它回答的问题</h2><p>中国应急预案不是一份文件，而是一个<strong>三层结构</strong>，层级由「事故影响范围」而非「仓库大小」决定。《生产安全事故应急预案管理办法》（应急管理部令第 2 号）把预案分为综合、专项、现场处置方案三级并分别规定演练频次——这是本文所有频次数字的权威来源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>谁编制</th>\n<th>最低演练频次</th>\n<th>备案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>综合应急预案</td>\n<td>全仓总体应急方针、组织架构、分级响应</td>\n<td>仓主要负责人牵头</td>\n<td>每年至少一次</td>\n<td>公布后 20 个工作日内分级备案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专项应急预案</td>\n<td>单类事故：泄漏、火灾、中毒、爆炸</td>\n<td>安全/运营部门</td>\n<td>每年至少一次</td>\n<td>随综合预案一并备案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现场处置方案</td>\n<td>单个岗位/单个设备的即时动作卡</td>\n<td>班组/岗位</td>\n<td>每半年至少一次</td>\n<td>内部留存，不单独备案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>办法<strong>第三十二条</strong>原文即：「每年至少组织一次综合应急预案演练或者专项应急预案演练，每半年至少组织一次现场处置方案演练。」综合与专项是「或」的关系。但更严的一条来自行政法规《生产安全事故应急条例》<strong>第八条</strong>：危险化学品等高危单位「应当至少每半年组织 1 次生产安全事故应急救援预案演练」，并须将演练情况报送属地负有安全监管职责的部门，监管部门可以抽查。<strong>一个跨境危品仓的合规下限不是「一年一次」，而是「每半年一次」，且要留痕可查</strong>。</p>\n<p>预案本身也有寿命。办法<strong>第三十五条</strong>要求「每三年至少进行一次应急预案评估」，形成书面报告作为修订依据。关键词是<strong>评估</strong>而非重编：三年是评估周期，真正的修订触发条件是<strong>第三十六条</strong>列举的情形——法规标准变化、组织架构或工艺变化、演练暴露重大缺陷、周边环境改变等。一个每年改布局的跨境电商仓，实际修订频率会远高于三年。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从报警到收容-分级响应的动作序列\">从报警到收容：分级响应的动作序列</h2><p>响应不是「拉总警报、全员跑」，而是<strong>按事故规模逐级升级</strong>。分级错了会导致两种失败：小泄漏拉全仓警报，几次之后人员对警报脱敏；大火灾只报班组级，错过初期 3 分钟扑救窗口。下图是一次泄漏从探测到危废移交的链路，菱形节点是<strong>升级判据</strong>——决定要不要往上跳一级的客观条件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[探测:气体探测/目视/人员报告] --&gt; B{泄漏量 ≤ 现场处置能力?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是,且无人员受伤| C[现场处置方案启动&lt;br/&gt;班组级:围堵/吸附/疏散邻近]&#10;    B --&gt;|否,或涉及 Class 2/6.1/7| D[专项预案启动&lt;br/&gt;仓级:警戒/通风/专业队介入]&#10;    C --&gt; E{30 分钟内是否收容成功?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[清洗现场,废物分类装桶]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| D&#10;    D --&gt; G{是否起火或火势蔓延?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| H[专业堵漏队 + 围堰导流&lt;br/&gt;同步通知属地应急部门]&#10;    G --&gt;|是| I[全员撤离 + 报火警&lt;br/&gt;移交外部消防,仓方提供货物信息]&#10;    H --&gt; F&#10;    I --&gt; J[事故调查 + 预案评估]&#10;    F --&gt; K[危废暂存 → 委托有资质单位处置]&#10;    J --&gt; L[修订预案 → 下次演练验证]&#10;    K --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n    A[探测:气体探测/目视/人员报告] --&gt; B{泄漏量 ≤ 现场处置能力?}\n    B --&gt;|是,且无人员受伤| C[现场处置方案启动&lt;br/&gt;班组级:围堵/吸附/疏散邻近]\n    B --&gt;|否,或涉及 Class 2/6.1/7| D[专项预案启动&lt;br/&gt;仓级:警戒/通风/专业队介入]\n    C --&gt; E{30 分钟内是否收容成功?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[清洗现场,废物分类装桶]\n    E --&gt;|否| D\n    D --&gt; G{是否起火或火势蔓延?}\n    G --&gt;|否| H[专业堵漏队 + 围堰导流&lt;br/&gt;同步通知属地应急部门]\n    G --&gt;|是| I[全员撤离 + 报火警&lt;br/&gt;移交外部消防,仓方提供货物信息]\n    H --&gt; F\n    I --&gt; J[事故调查 + 预案评估]\n    F --&gt; K[危废暂存 → 委托有资质单位处置]\n    J --&gt; L[修订预案 → 下次演练验证]\n    K --&gt; J</pre><p>三个设计要点：<strong>升级判据必须是客观量</strong>（泄漏量、是否涉及特定类别、时间窗），不能是「现场负责人判断」；<strong>Class 2（气体）、6.1（毒性）、7（放射性）一律直跳仓级</strong>，因其最小致命量远小于同重量的易燃液体；<strong>火势失控后仓方角色从「处置者」切换为「信息提供者」</strong>，向消防提供 UN 编号、类别、隔离组、堆存量分布图，这个切换点必须在预案里写死，否则会出现未经防护的员工冲进火场。</p>\n<p>响应时间可拆解为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{resp} = T_{detect} + T_{notify} + T_{mobilize} + T_{contain}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。四项里只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{contain}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 依赖现场处置技能，前三项完全是<strong>预案与演练的产物</strong>。很多仓库盯着 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{contain}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 训练，响应时间却卡在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{notify}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——报警按钮位置不熟、值班电话记不住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"货物级的应急调度-erg-与-ems-双轨\">货物级的应急调度：ERG 与 EmS 双轨</h2><p>预案给的是「流程」，但具体到「这桶东西泄漏了用什么中和、隔离多少米」，流程答不了。这里需要<strong>按货物查表</strong>，跨境的危品仓通常并行两套表：</p>\n<p><strong>陆运/国内段用 ERG。</strong> 美国交通部管道与危险材料安全管理局（PHMSA）发布的《应急响应指南》（ERG）四年修订一版，现行版本为 2024 版。它用四个颜色页组织：黄页按 UN 编号、蓝页按名称，两者都指向同一个<strong>指南号（Guide Number）</strong>；橙页是该指南号的处置建议；绿页是<strong>初始隔离与防护行动距离</strong>——给出「泄漏时下风向多少距离内必须疏散」的具体数字，按白天/夜间、小量/大量泄漏分四象限。仓库若只挂橙页、不查绿页，等于放弃了唯一可量化的人员保护依据。</p>\n<p><strong>海运段用 EmS Guide。</strong> IMO 的《EmS 指南》与 IMDG Code 配套，为每个条目分配一个应急调度号，分 <strong>Schedule F</strong>（火灾）与 <strong>Schedule S</strong>（泄漏）两类；IMDG Code 第 <strong>7.8 章</strong>专门规定「事故与涉及危险货物的火灾预防的特殊要求」；人员中毒的医疗急救另查 <strong>MFAG</strong>。对危品仓的实际含义是：<strong>同一批货在仓库、在船上、在公路上对应三份不同的应急指引，仓库必须先做映射</strong>。若上游做过 <a href=\"../dg-classification-storable/dg-sds-label-data-model\">SDS、UN 标签与危品基础数据建模</a>，UN 编号到三种编号的映射只是三张关联表；否则事故当天要靠人翻纸质书找。</p>\n<h2 id=\"演练-桌面推演-功能演练与实战拉动\">演练：桌面推演、功能演练与实战拉动</h2><p>演练按投入和保真度分三档，<strong>三档要交替使用</strong>，因为它们的缺陷检测能力完全不同。<strong>桌面推演（Tabletop）</strong> 是管理层围坐讨论「如果发生 X 会怎样」，成本极低、可覆盖罕见场景，缺陷是<strong>检测不出执行层的问题</strong>——座位上演得通的动作，在现场可能因通道被托盘占满而做不了。<strong>功能演练（Functional Drill）</strong> 检验单一功能，如报警系统、气体探测联动、应急照明、通信链路。<strong>实战拉动（Full-scale Exercise）</strong> 是全流程、全员、接近真实的模拟，成本最高，危化品单位按前述条例须每半年一次并报送属地监管部门。</p>\n<p>务实组合是：现场处置方案用<strong>班组级短周期演练</strong>（每半年至少一次，实际可每月不通知时间抽演），综合/专项预案用<strong>年度实战拉动 + 季度桌面推演</strong>。演练记录应形成可审计的证据链，至少包含：时间、地点、参演人员、模拟场景、<strong>升级判据是否被执行</strong>、响应时间分解值、缺陷清单、整改责任人与期限。<strong>没有缺陷清单的演练记录，等同于没有演练</strong>——它的目的不是证明「我们合格」，而是发现预案里哪一条在真实现场跑不通。演练价值不在次数，而在<strong>缺陷修复的闭环率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{drill} = N_{fixed} / N_{found} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"演练为何失效-五种反复出现的模式\">演练为何失效：五种反复出现的模式</h2><p>演练走过场有固定的失败模式，识别它们比增加演练次数更有效：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>修正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>剧本化</td>\n<td>参演者提前知道剧本与时间</td>\n<td>不预先通知时间与场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判据缺失</td>\n<td>升级判据从未在演练中被触发</td>\n<td>设计边界场景逼出升级决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单向指挥</td>\n<td>只有指挥链向下，无向上反馈</td>\n<td>加入「一线可否决」机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无量测</td>\n<td>只记录「完成」，无响应时间分解</td>\n<td>强制记录 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{detect}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等四项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无闭环</td>\n<td>缺陷清单没有责任人</td>\n<td>缺陷进工单系统，与考核挂钩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个在高保真演练中反复暴露的问题是<strong>防护等级与任务不匹配</strong>：把需要 B 级防护的堵漏任务交给只有普通工作服的人员，或反过来让全副重型防护的人在无害泄漏前中暑。这本质上是 HAZWOPER 体系里「应急响应人员资质分级」要解决的问题——OSHA 的 29 CFR 1910.120(q) 要求有应急响应计划并对响应人员分级培训，计划需<strong>每年审查</strong>。仓库应明确<strong>谁有资格进入热区</strong>及所需的防护与培训记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与危废处置的衔接\">与危废处置的衔接</h2><p>应急响应的最后一步不是「现场清理干净」，而是<strong>把事故产生的废物合法地送出去</strong>。一次泄漏会同时产生三股废物流，各自危废属性不同，绝不能混装：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>吸附/中和后的残液与吸附棉</strong>——主废物流，危废类别由被泄漏货物决定，需按危废管理台账登记。</li>\n<li><strong>被污染的包装物</strong>（破损的桶、被浸透的托盘）——同样按危废管理，不能当普通垃圾。</li>\n<li><strong>清洗水与围堰内的消防废水</strong>——最容易被忽略的一股。火灾扑救产生的消防废水含大量溶解态危险物质，若直接排入雨水管网即构成环境违法，排水系统必须能切换到事故模式（关闭雨水阀、导向事故水池）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三股废物都遵循「暂存 → 委托有资质单位处置 → 转移联单」的路径。<strong>应急与危废衔接的真正测试点，是演练时有没有真的走一遍废水拦截与危废暂存动作</strong>——很多仓库演练到「泄漏被吸干」就结束，把最不合规的一段留给了真实事故。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>危品仓应急预案是<strong>三层结构</strong>：综合、专项、现场处置方案；《生产安全事故应急预案管理办法》第三十二条规定综合/专项每年至少一次、现场处置每半年至少一次演练。</li>\n<li><strong>危化品单位的合规下限更严</strong>：《生产安全事故应急条例》第八条要求至少每半年一次演练并报送属地监管部门；办法第三十五条要求每三年至少评估一次预案。</li>\n<li>分级响应的核心是<strong>客观升级判据</strong>；Class 2/6.1/7 一律直跳仓级；火势失控后仓方角色从处置者切换为信息提供者。</li>\n<li>总响应时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{resp} = T_{detect} + T_{notify} + T_{mobilize} + T_{contain}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，前三项取决于预案与演练而非个人技能。</li>\n<li>货物级处置靠<strong>双轨查表</strong>：陆运查 ERG（2024 版，绿页给出初始隔离与防护距离），海运查 EmS Guide 的 Schedule F/S，中毒查 MFAG。</li>\n<li>演练分桌面推演、功能演练、实战拉动三档，需交替使用；<strong>没有缺陷清单的演练记录等同于没有演练</strong>，缺陷以闭环率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{drill}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 追踪。</li>\n<li>应急的最后一步是危废衔接：泄漏残液、污染包装、消防废水三股废物流分别按危废处置，排水系统须能切换到事故模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>数据来源</strong>：《生产安全事故应急预案管理办法》（应急管理部令第 2 号）第三十二、三十五、三十六条；《生产安全事故应急条例》第八条；IMO《EmS 指南》与 IMDG Code 第 7.8 章；PHMSA ERG 2024 版；OSHA 29 CFR 1910.120(q)；EPA 40 CFR 112。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"泄漏与火灾应急预案及演练","id":"泄漏与火灾应急预案及演练"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三层预案体系与它回答的问题","id":"核心概念-三层预案体系与它回答的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"从报警到收容：分级响应的动作序列","id":"从报警到收容-分级响应的动作序列"},{"level":2,"text":"货物级的应急调度：ERG 与 EmS 双轨","id":"货物级的应急调度-erg-与-ems-双轨"},{"level":2,"text":"演练：桌面推演、功能演练与实战拉动","id":"演练-桌面推演-功能演练与实战拉动"},{"level":2,"text":"演练为何失效：五种反复出现的模式","id":"演练为何失效-五种反复出现的模式"},{"level":2,"text":"与危废处置的衔接","id":"与危废处置的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"危品拣货复核与合规装车","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-inventory-operation/dg-outbound-picking-vehicle-loading"},"next":{"title":"危废收集、转移联单与处置台账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-emergency-waste/dg-hazwaste-disposal-chain"}}